# November 18, 2026: northern and eastern Rensselaer County outside Troy: the Town of Hoosick (Hoosick Falls, North
# Hoosick, Walloomsac, Buskirk), Pittstown and Valley Falls, Schaghticoke, Brunswick and Petersburgh. Drawn at random by
# tools/choose.py --state ny (region renss, 13 places, most of them LiDAR leads). Mostly standing buildings, with the
